Native code
-----------
  The Rust crate `numfast-native` (this repository, `numfast-native/`) has NO
  third-party dependencies. `numfast-native/Cargo.lock` contains exactly one
  package, `numfast-native`. There is therefore no Rust licence exposure to
  attribute. The crate itself is AGPL-3.0-only, as declared in its
  `Cargo.toml`.

  The crate is loaded at run time through `ctypes` from
  `numfast/_native/numfast_native.dll` (or `.so`). No Rust or C source from
  any third party is vendored into this repository or into the wheel.

